  "descriptionHtml": "<p>The Kayla crossbody bag streamlines your day with a rounded silhouette and triple interior compartments, so you can stay organized from morning brunch to evenings out. An adjustable strap fits comfortably, and the magnetic front pocket keeps your phone within reach. Gold hardware accents and soft pebbled leather add a polished finish to our small crossbody bag.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> Pebbled leather</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> Lining: fabric</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Strap Drop: 22&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Interior triple compartment</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip closure</li>\n<li><strong>Hardware:</strong> Gold hardware (black, bungalow); silver hardware (elm, lime frosting)</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 9.6&quot; (L) x 6.8&quot; (H) x 1.8&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
